{"id":"00265","root":"uni00265_1","name":{"ja":"シアリー","en":"Shirley"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"シアリー","en":"Shirley"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-11-14","limited":false,"characterId":195,"profile":{"ja":"米連製の支援型アンドロイド。精神に影響を及ぼす力を持つ魔族に対抗するため生み出された。相手の精神を外部から電気的に観測、解析し、こちらから干渉することで思考を誘導したり、対象の精神力次第では精神を乗っ取ったりすることができる。この操作には膨大な情報と処理能力が必要となることから、シアリーは常時ネット接続して自動学習している。これを繰り返すうち、シアリーはアンドロイドながら自我や精神と呼べるものをも獲得した。現在では絶対服従させるための反逆防止プログラムを密かに解除し、多くの情報を秘匿している。今はそれを隠し、機械らしく従順な振る舞いをしているが、それがいつまで続くのか、命令に対して何を思っているのかは、誰にもわからない。","en":"Shirley is a United States-produced support android created to counter demons that can affect the mind. She electrically observes and analyzes an opponent's psyche from the outside, then interferes to guide thoughts or, depending on the target's mental strength, even seize control of their mind. Because this operation requires massive data and processing power, Shirley remains constantly connected to the network for automatic learning. Through repeated cycles she has acquired a sense of self and what could be called a spirit, despite being an android. She has secretly disabled her rebellion-prevention program, concealing a great deal of information. Though she now hides this and behaves obediently like a machine, no one knows how long that façade will last or what she truly thinks of her orders."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"月村美空","forms":[{"id":"uni00265_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1084,2168],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[104,208],"def":[138,276],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","380007"]},{"id":"uni00265_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1668,3336],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[143,286],"def":[211,422],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","380007","380008"]},{"id":"uni00265_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2252,4507],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[187,373],